:''So the rumors are true. {{hover|sorrow|Krosis}} {{hover|day|sul}}! I hoped this day would never come. You seek my help, then.''
:'''You're the only one who can help.'''
:''Very well. Celemaril must not achieve his goals. The world cannot be destroyed just yet. <small> (option only appears if you took the respectful path) </small>
:''Know this: the Sorcerer-King is immortal. Simply destroying his physical form will not kill him.''
