::''"Have you already found the [[BL:Elder Scroll|Elder Scroll]]?''
::'''We have.'''
:''The {{hover|Elder Scroll|Kel}}, the Elder Scroll, can affect all possible futures. you must bind the Sorcerer-King to the one where he fails to escape.<br>You will also need the incantation that was used to bind his spirit in ancient times.<br>Defeat Celemaril in combat. A pure heart must read the incantation while wearing his lost crown.<br>Celemaril's ancient crown is another matter. I do not know where it may now be found.''
::'''That's it?'''
::''Yes. That should not be too hard for you, {{hover|warrior|kendov}}.''
::'''Thank you for your help, great Shulkunaak.'''
::''Do not thank me yet. Now you must prove yourself worthy to face the Sorcerer-King.''
::'''It doesn't have to be this way.'''
