::''{{hover|I|Zu'u}} {{hover|not|ni}} {{hover|fool|mey}}. I did not survive this long without knowing a Blade when I see one.''  <small> (Saashi will learn the player is a Blade) </small>
::''Have the Blades forgotten their sworn duty as dragonslayers? I assure you, I have not.''
:::'''I don't care, this is unfair.'''
::::''Fairness is irrelevant. Either you are a <man/woman> of honor, and you fight.<br>Or you are not honorable, and I kill you.<br>Now honor your comrades, and fight me! {{hover|Join|Aav}} {{hover|battle|grah}}!''
:::::'''Very well.'''
::::::''I knew you were a <man/woman> of honor. {{hover|Join|Aav}} {{hover|battle|grah}}!''
:::'''Not if I kill you first.'''
::::''Aav grah! Let us test ourselves against each other, <Player.Name>!''

Once enough damage has been dealt to Shulkunaak the following dialogue will begin:

::''Enough. You have proven your worth.<br>{{hover|Peace|Drem}} {{hover|to|wah}} {{hover|you|hi}}. Go in peace, Blade.''
::'''You have my gratitude, and that of my town.'''
::''None of that will matter until you use it to stop Celemaril. {{hover|Fight with courage|Krif voth ahkrin.}}''
