Shulkunaak's bite deals both [[BL:Cleaving Damage|cleaving damage]] and [[BL:Shock Damage|shock damage]]. He knows one spell: Delayed Lightning Bolt.

After you defeat Shulkunaak and finish his dialogue, he will go back to sleep. Talk to him again and he will say:
:''I have told you everything I know. The rest is up to you.''

If you take the left fork from where Shulkunaak is, you can find a silver chest. Go down the right path, eventually you will find Saashi at the other end, who will say:
:''Hello! Saashi found another entrance to the cavern.''

:''You've met the dragon, yes? And he did not kill you, this is good!'' <small> (if the encounter was amicable) </small>
:''You have returned!'' <small> (if the encounter was aggressive) </small>
::'''And I know how to beat the Sorcerer-King.'''
:::''You do? That is wonderful! Oh, Saashi has so many questions!''
:::'''I'll fill you in on the way back.'''
:::''Yes, apologies. Saashi is excited. Let us return home.''
::'''You sound surprised...'''
:::''Surprised? Of... Of course not. Saashi is simply relieved to see <Player.Name> in one piece, and... well, relatively unburnt.''
:::''So, how did it go? Did you kill the dragon? How big was he? Did he tell you how to defeat the Sorcerer-King?''
:::'''Whoa, easy... I'll tell you all on the way back.'''
:::''Yes, apologies. Saashi is excited. Let us return home.''

Talk to Saashi again and she will say:
:''Ready to go? Saashi cannot wait to hear all about the encounter with Shulkunaak!''

===Back to Town===
====Saashi====
:''This one still cannot believe you were able to defeat Shulkunaak.''
::'''Now we know how to bind the Sorcerer-King.'''
:::''You are right, of course. At least now we have a fighting chance.''
::'''I never thought I'd fight a real dragon.'''
:::''Sad to think he might be the last of his kind, too.''

If Saashi overheard Shulkunaak mention that the player is a Blade, she will have special dialogue added:
:::''Also, this one *may* have overheard <Player.Name>'s conversation with Shulkunaak...''
:::'''You did?'''
:::''Saashi will keep your secret safe.''
:::'''Thank you, I appreciate it.'''

This segues directly to MQ18
