==Notes==
Instead of talking to Saashi in the cave behind Shulkunaak, you can backtrack to the beginning of the cave to find another copy of Saashi still here. Speaking to her at this location, she will skip the ''"Hello! Saashi found another entrance to the cavern."'' line.
